1. CODE — the site's build tooling and presentation layer: everything in
   `templates/`, `migrate/`, the shell scripts (`build.sh`, `dev.sh`,
   `preview.sh`, `deploy.sh`), `zola.toml`, and the CSS/JS/fonts under
   `static/` that are not episode or brew imagery. Licensed under the MIT
   License below.

2. CONTENT — the podcast itself: all episode text, show notes, transcripts,
   episode and brew descriptions, and all artwork and photography (including
   everything under `content/`, `src/content/`, `data/`, and the images under
   `static/images/`). Copyright © 2021–2026 Friends with Brews. All rights
   reserved. The content is published here for transparency and for building
   the website; it is NOT covered by the MIT License and may not be
   republished, redistributed, or used to create derivative works without
   permission. Contact: scott@beepingmachine.com

